atrix}+5\\cdot \\begin{vmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & ={k}^{2}(3\\cdot 2-4\\cdot (-1))+2(1\\cdot 2-4\\cdot 0)+5(1\\cdot -1-3\\cdot 0) \\\\  & ={k}^{2}(6+4)+2(2)+5(-1) \\\\  & =10{k}^{2}+4-5 \\\\  & =10{k}^{2}-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThree vectors are coplanar if and only if their triple product is zero:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x\\cdot (y\\times z) & =0 \\\\ 10{k}^{2}-1 & =0 \\\\ 10{k}^{2} & =1 \\\\ {k}^{2} & =\\frac{1}{10} \\\\ k & =\\pm \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{10}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the three vectors are coplanar if and only if \n$k=-\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{10}}$ or $k=\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{10}}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186400338 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ae4f142e-64ca-5cf1-bba5-1bb7e5f38aea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439465} {:answer/id #uuid "de3a62f1-ef79-57d9-abd6-9050be028873" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439466}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ae4f142e-64ca-5cf1-bba5-1bb7e5f38aea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439465} :answer-field/id #uuid "f3764177-45a2-558b-9c90-1ce74f89c430" :answer-field/key "$k=-6$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440090} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "df688db8-1580-5d94-85cf-dbb0c6d9127f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439467} {:answer/id #uuid "1ae03a63-04c8-5456-b96a-9013a1f5b82f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439468}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1ae03a63-04c8-5456-b96a-9013a1f5b82f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186